@startuml
[*] --> Initial State
Initial State --> Create Budget : User starts creating a budget
Create Budget --> Track Expenses : User starts tracking expenses
Create Budget --> View Budget Summary : User views budget summary
Track Expenses --> Update Budget : Expense added exceeds budget
Track Expenses --> Check Goals : Expense added
Check Goals --> [*] : Goals met
Check Goals --> Send Alert : Goals not met
Send Alert --> Update Budget : User updates budget
Update Budget --> View Budget Summary : Budget updated
View Budget Summary --> [*] : User exits
[*] <-- Final State
@enduml
